---
title: "Question lifecycle: one question in the Analysis tree"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: start
    lg1: running
    lg2: answered
    lg3: stopped
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 orange
  s0: Question picked
  s1: Computing (built-in, no model)
  s2: Agent working
  s3: Answered
  s4: Running a Tool
  s5: Cancelled
  s6: Error, Retry offered
  s7: Stopped at a limit
  s8: Writing the answer
  s9: Verdict recorded
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s2: you ask [needs the agent]
  s0 --> s1: you ask [built-in with a Tool]
  s1 --> s3: the Tool returns
  s2 --> s4: the agent calls a Tool [budget left beyond the answer]
  s2 --> s5: you press Cancel
  s2 --> s6: the model call fails
  s2 --> s7: 10 minutes pass or the agent wants more [budget used up]
  s2 --> s8: the agent starts answering [a turn left]
  s3 --> s9: you give a verdict
  s4 --> s5: you press Cancel
  s4 --> s7: 10 minutes pass
  s4 --> s2: the Tool returns
  s6 --> s2: you press Retry
  s7 --> s2: you continue with a new cap [once, no Tool still running]
  s8 --> s3: the answer finishes
  s8 --> s5: you press Cancel
  s8 --> s6: the model call fails
  s8 --> s7: 10 minutes pass
  class s0 tan
  class s1 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s3 teal
  class s4 blue
  class s5 orange
  class s6 orange
  class s7 orange
  class s8 blue
  class s9 teal
